# Google sign-in (frontend). Without it the access screen only offers the local profile.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Web client at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and add the
# origins you use under "Authorized JavaScript origins" (dev server: http://localhost:3000).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# There is NO Gemini key here any more (BYOK): the AI reading (Scontrino IA, invoices, price list) is called straight from the
# browser with the user's own Google AI Studio key, which each user pastes in Ajustes > Operaciones y sincronización
# (kept only on their device). Nothing to configure on the server. Create a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey.
